 mix and match</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3319150/extras/0be92cef070689cb07d4e7352f1cd6a5.poster.avif?t=1752569565\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3319150/extras/0be92cef070689cb07d4e7352f1cd6a5.webm?t=1752569565\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3319150/extras/0be92cef070689cb07d4e7352f1cd6a5.mp4?t=1752569565\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Brain-tickling puzzles</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3319150/extras/1f0312c99e5f722a62f8207da7a2c9ff.poster.avif?t=1752569565\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3319150/extras/1f0312c99e5f722a62f8207da7a2c9ff.webm?t=1752569565\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3319150/extras/1f0312c99e5f722a62f8207da7a2c9ff.mp4?t=1752569565\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weapons that pack a punch but are fun to wield</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3319150/extras/e067986040acf1347f5f222bfcb20b82.poster.avif?t=1752569565\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3319150/extras/e067986040acf1347f5f222bfcb20b82.webm?t=1752569565\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://share